INFO
====

General folders
---------------

```
~/
    .agents/
        agents/         # dépôt commun éventuel (mais formats à adapter)
        skills/         # skills partagés
        instructions.md # instructions communes (AGENTS.md)
    .claude/
        agents/
        rules/          # instructions spécifiques à Claude
        plugins/
        skills/         # can't read skills/childDirectory/SKILL.md, use plugin instead
        CLAUDE.md
    .copilot/
        agents/
        instructions/   # instructions spécifiques à Copilot
        plugins/
        skills/         # symlink:~/.agents/skills
        copilot-instructions.md
    .gemini/
        agents/
        skills/         # symlink:~/.agents/skills
        GEMINI.md
```

Configuration
-------------

Instructions:
**General**
Each tools must have its own instructions configuration
- ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md
- ~/.copilot/copilot-instructions.md
- ~/.gemini/GEMINI.md
**Specific**
- ~/.claude/rules/*.md
- ~/.copilot/instructions/*.md
- Gemini do not have "specific" instructions

Skills:
- ~/.agents/skills is auto-discovered by Copilot and Gemini
- ~/.claude/skills for Claude

Agents:
Each agent must be on its own tool configuration
- ~/.claude/agents/
- ~/.copilot/agents/
- ~/.gemini/agents/


Symlinks
--------

Just symlink ~/.agents/skills for instructions and Claude
```shell
# mkdir -p ~/.agents/skills/custom ~/.agents/agents/custom ~/.claude ~/.copilot ~/.gemini

ln -s ~/.agents/instructions.md ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md
ln -s ~/.agents/instructions.md ~/.copilot/copilot-instructions.md
ln -s ~/.agents/instructions.md ~/.gemini/GEMINI.md

# Claude: use plugins with agents and skills, then run in Claude
/plugin marketplace add ~/.claude/plugins/my-plugin
/plugin install my-plugin@my-marketplace
```
